	<main class="site-main">

		
<div  class="s-section s-section--background-colour-white s-section--padding-top-none s-section--padding-bottom-small default s-full-width" id="custom-hero-video-section" style="--highlight-colour : #054A73">

<div class="wrap-lockup wrap-lockup--content-width">
<div  class="m-spacer reveal-waiting m-spacer--3x" data-reveal="up"></div>

<div  class="m-carousel m-carousel--hero reveal-waiting m-carousel--navigation-false m-carousel--pagination-true m-hero-video" data-reveal="up">
    <div  class="m-carousel__carousel swiper" data-autoplay="5000" data-navigation="false" data-pagination="true" data-loop="true" data-effect="fade" data-thumbnails="false">
        <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                            <article class="swiper-slide">
                    <div class="slide__lockup">
                        
                        
                                                    
<div  class="media-lockup media-lockup--natural media-lockup--full media-lockup--align-left slide__media" style="--aspect-ratio: 38.7%">

    <img  class="media-lockup__media lazyload is-landscape" data-src="https://www.latrobefinancial.com.au/app/uploads/Screenshot-2026-10-05-at-2.20.20-PM.png" data-srcset="https://www.latrobefinancial.com.au/app/uploads/Screenshot-2026-10-05-at-2.20.20-PM.png 1398w, https://www.latrobefinancial.com.au/app/uploads/Screenshot-2026-10-05-at-2.20.20-PM-300x116.png 300w, https://www.latrobefinancial.com.au/app/uploads/Screenshot-2026-10-05-at-2.20.20-PM-1024x396.png 1024w, https://www.latrobefinancial.com.au/app/uploads/Screenshot-2026-10-05-at-2.20.20-PM-768x297.png 768w" width="1398" height="540">
</div>
                                                    
                                                    <div class="slide__content-lockup">
                                                                                                        <h3 class="type-style-h3 slide__heading">
                                        Not by Luck, by Design                                     </h3>
                                
                                                                    <div class="slide__content content">
                                        <p>Since 1952, La Trobe Financial has helped Australians build and preserve wealth through disciplined investment management, prudent lending practices and an unwavering focus on capital preservation. Proven through decades of market cycles, our approach is designed to provide investors with confidence in both their capital and their income.<sup>~ </sup></p>
<p><sup>~ </sup> Past performance is not a reliable indicator of future performance.</p>

										
										<div class="m-carousel__button-lockup">
											                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                                            </div>
                        
                        	
                    </div>
                                                            </article>
                            <article class="swiper-slide">
                    <div class="slide__lockup">
                        
                        
                                                    
<div  class="media-lockup media-lockup--natural media-lockup--full media-lockup--align-left slide__media" style="--aspect-ratio: 38.7%">

    <video  muted loop playsinline autoplay class="media-lockup__media"><source  src="https://www.latrobefinancial.com.au/app/uploads/LTF100106815-website_no-rate.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
</div>
                                                    
                                                    <div class="slide__content-lockup">
                                                                                                        <h3 class="type-style-h3 slide__heading">
                                        Looking Out For You                                    </h3>
                                
                                                                    <div class="slide__content content">
                                        <p>For over seventy years, La Trobe Financial has constructed resilient portfolios that aim to deliver consistent monthly returns for our investors. We’re committed to helping Australians prepare for, and enjoy, a dignified retirement.</p>

										
										<div class="m-carousel__button-lockup">
